  {
    "type": "intro",
    "page": "introduction",
    "head": {
      "title": {
        "en": "INTRODUCTION",
        "zh": "简介"
      }
    },
    "notes": [
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "PhysiClaw",
          "zh": "PhysiClaw"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "PhysiClaw is a physically interactive agent. It operates a phone by tapping on the screen, so it needs hardware to carry out those taps. This manual covers the assembly of that hardware. The hardware has three parts. A CoreXY stage moves across the X/Y plane. A touch end presses the screen along the Z axis. A camera watches the screen.",
          "zh": "PhysiClaw 是能与物理世界交互的智能体。它通过点击屏幕操作手机，因此需要一套硬件来执行点击。本手册介绍这套硬件的装配。硬件分为三部分。CoreXY 结构在 X/Y 平面内移动。触控机构沿 Z 轴按压屏幕。摄像头观察屏幕。"
        },
        "classes": "note"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Before you begin",
          "zh": "准备工作"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Read this manual all the way through. Compare the parts you bought with the bill of materials. Make sure that nothing is missing. Assembly of a PhysiClaw takes about 3 hours, so set aside enough time.",
          "zh": "请通读本手册。对照物料清单清点已购零件。确认没有缺漏。装配一台 PhysiClaw 约需 3 小时，请预留足够时间。"
        },
        "classes": "note"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Report an issue",
          "zh": "反馈问题"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "If you find an error in this manual, or have a suggestion, please open an issue on GitHub (<a href=\"https://github.com/physiclaw/PhysiClaw/issues\">github.com/physiclaw/PhysiClaw/issues</a>). Include the page numbers and a short description. Annotated screenshots are also welcome. We update the manual periodically based on the feedback we get.",
          "zh": "如果发现本手册有错误，或有改进建议，请到 GitHub 提交 issue（<a href=\"https://github.com/physiclaw/PhysiClaw/issues\">github.com/physiclaw/PhysiClaw/issues</a>）。请写明相关页码，并简要描述问题。也欢迎附上带标注的截图。我们会根据反馈定期更新手册。"
        },
        "classes": "note"
      }
    ],
