        "h3": {
          "en": "File naming",
          "zh": "文件命名"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "A file name that ends in <span class=\"ref\">_x#</span> gives the quantity of that part in the machine. For example, the machine needs two of <span class=\"ref\">idler_mount_front_x2.step</span>.",
          "zh": "文件名末尾的 <span class=\"ref\">_x#</span> 表示整机需要的数量。例如 <span class=\"ref\">idler_mount_front_x2.step</span> 需要两个。"
